#: kaddrbook.cpp:67 kaddrbook.cpp:104
msgid "Cannot save to addressbook."
msgstr "Ne mogu snimiti u adresar."

#: kaddrbook.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<qt>The email address <b>%1</b> was added to your addressbook; you can add "
"more information to this entry by opening the addressbook.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Email adresa <b>%1</b> je dodana u vaš adresar; možete dodati više "
"informacija o ovom kontaktu otvaranjem adresara.</qt>"

#: kaddrbook.cpp:75
msgid "<qt>The email address <b>%1</b> is already in your addressbook.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Email adresa <b>%1</b> je već u vašem adresaru.</qt>"

#: kaddrbook.cpp:107
msgid ""
"The VCard was added to your addressbook; you can add more information to "
"this entry by opening the addressbook."
msgstr ""
"VCard je dodana u vaš adresar; možete dodati više informacija o ovom "
"kontaktu otvaranjem adresara."

#: kaddrbook.cpp:114
msgid ""
"The VCard's primary email address is already in your addressbook; however, "
"you may save the VCard into a file and import it into the addressbook "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Primarna adresa iz VCard je već u vašem adresaru; ipak, možete snimiti "
"VCard u datoteku i uvesti ga u adresar ručno."

#: kmime_mdn.cpp:54
msgid ""
"The message sent on ${date} to ${to} with subject \"${subject}\" has been "
"displayed. This is no guarantee that the message has been read or understood."
msgstr ""
"Poruka poslana ${date} za ${to} sa temom \"${subject}\" je prikazana. Ovo "
"nije garancija da je poruka pročitana ili pravilno protumačena."

#: kmime_mdn.cpp:58
msgid ""
"The message sent on ${date} to ${to} with subject \"${subject}\" has been "
"deleted unseen. This is no guarantee that the message will not be "
"\"undeleted\" and nonetheless read later on."
msgstr ""
"Poruka poslana ${date} za ${to} sa temom \"${subject}\" je izbrisana prije "
"čitanja. Ovo nije garancija da poruka neće biti vraćena iz \"Smeća\" i "
"kasnije možda biti pročitana."

#: kmime_mdn.cpp:63
msgid ""
"The message sent on ${date} to ${to} with subject \"${subject}\" has been "
"dispatched. This is no guarantee that the message will not be read later on."
msgstr ""
"Poruka poslana ${date} za ${to} sa temom \"${subject}\" je premještena. Ovo "
"nije garancija da poruka kasnije neće biti pročitana."

#: kmime_mdn.cpp:67
msgid ""
"The message sent on ${date} to ${to} with subject \"${subject}\" has been "
"processed by some automatic means."
msgstr ""
"Poruka poslana ${date} za ${to} sa temom \"${subject}\" je obrađena na neki "
"automatski način."

#: kmime_mdn.cpp:70
msgid ""
"The message sent on ${date} to ${to} with subject \"${subject}\" has been "
"acted upon. The sender does not wish to disclose more details to you than "
"that."
msgstr ""
"Na poruku poslanu ${date} za ${to} sa temom \"${subject}\" je reagovano. "
"Pošiljalac vam ne želi otkriti više detalja od ovoga.."

#: kmime_mdn.cpp:74
msgid ""
"Generation of a Message Disposition Notification for the message sent on "
"${date} to ${to} with subject \"${subject}\" failed. Reason is given in the "
"Failure: header field below."
msgstr ""
"Generiranje kontrolne poruke obavještenja za poruku poslanu ${date} za "
"${to} sa temom \"${subject}\" nije uspjelo. Razlog je dat u Failure: naslov "
"polju ispod."

#: kmime_util.cpp:655
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "nepoznato"

